{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pSxcLQqw3C1793680844.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>近日網上流傳一段影片，顯示有網民在九龍塘港鐵站內，發現一名男乘客於站內手持點燃的香煙前行，過程被拍下並上載至網絡。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-03-12h24m12s198.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mr6MJVrwjE1793680796.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片中所見，事發地點為九龍塘站內通道，現場環境人群密集、人流如織。該名男子手持點燃中的香煙在人群之間疾走前行，未有理會周圍環境及其他乘客。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-03-12h24m20s200.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Foo8Q1aQoK1793680802.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>相關片段引發網民廣泛討論，不少人批評該男子無視站內規則及公眾安全，留言質問：「地鐵站冇煙灰缸喎， 你諗住去邊度揼呀？」及「職員呢？」，同時亦有網民對其行為表示反感，留言指：「請大家食二手煙」、「去到邊衰到邊」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:35.925820+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:27.503665+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:38:53.039832+00:00","content_hash":"dbcb4f426b6ebff21d62a361faea1d489583a9cf1d9a6ea9dcf223cdde3bceb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:35.925820+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}